! Game text
| Use 1 Force to temporarily suspend a battle just initiated at a site where one of your Jedi is present. Draw destiny. That number of opponent's characters with ability = 1 (your choice) must move away (for free), or are lost. Battle continues. || {{Errata hl|If a battle was just initiated}} at a site where {{Errata hl|your}} Jedi is present, use 1 Force to draw destiny; that number of opponent's characters with ability = 1 (your choice) must {{Errata hl|each}} move away (for free), or {{Errata hl|be lost}}.
