== Editing ==
This shared table is the '''Errata''' section on English [[Decipher era]] [[Move Along...]] articles (unmarked original, (Errata), (PC Errata)). Do not transclude on Japanese, Unlimited, foil, Two-Player, or (V) articles. Use '''Edit errata''' on a member page. {{tl|Errata hl}} only the words or values that changed; an em dash if unchanged. See [[SWCCG Wiki:Style guide#Errata comparison table]].
